OL,3,GNEWSADuke of Edinburgh marks centenary
OL,4,Aof park with visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Edinburgh has visited a
OL,7,FBlackpool park to help mark its
OL,8,Fcentenary celebrations.
OL,10,FPrince Edward toured the Grade
OL,11,FII-listed grounds of Stanley Park on
OL,12,FTuesday after he unveiled a blue plaque
OL,13,Fcommemorating Dr William Henry Cocker,
OL,14,FBlackpool's first mayor, on the Cocker
OL,15,FClock Memorial Tower.
OL,17,FThe duke spoke to local school
OL,18,Fchildren, watched performances and
OL,19,Fchoir singers, and signed the Stanley
OL,20,FPark visitors' book before he left by
OL,21,Fhelicopter.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
