OL,3,GNEWSADuke of Edinburgh marks centenary
OL,4,Aof park with visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool South's MP Chris Webb said:
OL,7,F"It's great to have a royal stamp of
OL,8,Fapproval and for the Duke of Edinburgh
OL,9,Fto give his time today to come and
OL,10,Fvisit ahead of the 100-year centenary."
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
